# Compact "fast" mutation rules for hashcat (-r).
# A deliberately tiny subset of wifi-rules.rule (~10 rules) so dictionary +
# fast-rules fits a small per-stage budget on a slow GPU. The full rule set
# still runs later; this just guarantees the highest-value mutations happen
# even when the full set is skipped.
# c=Capitalize u=UPPER $x=append sxY=substitute
c
u
$1
$123
$1234
$2024
$2023
$!
sa@
se3
so0
